      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BROOKLYN (1) has mixed form but was in the money three back and wasn't far away last time at this track when fourth (20.82) in a TG1-4W. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. ALL IN ANGUS (2) has missed the frame at his last two but did run well three back when third (20.89) in a TG1-4W at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. COOL IT BUDDY (4) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (20.71) last time in a TG1-4W at this track. Has good early speed so he should be prominent despite the squeeze draw. Cannot be taken lightly. AXEL BREAKER (8) placed last time and cannot be ignored.",
